{"format":"vetro-plugin","version":1,"manifest":{"id":"keyboard","name":"Keyboard & Remote","version":"1.0.0","apiVersion":1,"permissions":["exec"],"author":"w4po","description":"Text typing for system inputs, live 1080p screen preview, and full TV remote with navigation, volume, channel, playback and color keys.","main":"index.js","ui":{"label":"Keyboard"}},"files":{"README.md":"# Keyboard & Remote\n\nType text in any language from your browser into focused input fields on your Samsung Smart TV, view a live 1080p screen preview, and control your TV with full navigation, volume, channel, media playback, and interactive color keys.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2781115-412a-4f0a-8b1d-e4fff6715e76\" alt=\"Keyboard & Remote Preview\" width=\"700\">\n</p>\n\n## What it does\n\nAdds a unified **Keyboard** tab to the Vetro dashboard:\n- **Text Input:** Type into the text box and press **Enter** (or click **Send**) to inject text in any language into apps using the TV's native input fields or virtual keyboard (e.g. Samsung Internet Browser address bar, system settings, Wi-Fi passwords, and login dialogs).\n- **Live Screen Preview:** One-click screen capture allows viewing what is currently displayed on the TV (menus, running apps, video playback, search boxes) directly inside your browser for true headless remote control. Expandable full-width preview with live auto-refresh and full image inspection.\n- **Navigation & D-Pad:** Full directional control (`Up`, `Down`, `Left`, `Right`, `OK`), `Home`, `Back`, `Menu`, `Info`, `Exit`.\n- **Volume & Channels:** `Volume +`, `Volume −`, `Mute`, `Channel +`, `Channel −`, `Previous Channel`, `Channel List`, `Guide`.\n- **Smooth Continuous Hold:** Press and hold arrow keys, volume, or channel buttons on your physical keyboard or screen to smoothly and continuously scroll without lag or stutter.\n- **System & Display:** `Power`, `TV / Source`, `Quick Menu`, `Search`, `Subtitles`, `MultiView`, `Aspect Ratio`, `Ambient mode`.\n- **Media Playback:** `Play`, `Pause`, `Play/Pause`, `Stop`, `Fast Forward`, `Rewind`, `Next`, `Previous`, `Record`.\n- **Interactive Color Keys:** Samsung remote `Red (A)`, `Green (B)`, `Yellow (C)`, `Blue (D)` buttons.\n- **Numeric Keypad:** Numbers `0`–`9` and `−` for direct channel entry.\n\n## Text Input & App Compatibility\n\nSamsung Smart TVs handle text entry in two different ways depending on the app:\n- **Native OS Input Fields (Direct Typing Supported):** Apps that use standard input fields invoke the TV's native system keyboard (such as the Samsung Internet Browser address bar, system settings, Wi-Fi password dialogs, account login screens, and web apps with native `<input>` elements). In these fields, text typed from the browser is injected directly into the active field in any language.\n- **Custom In-App Keyboards (Use D-Pad Navigation):** Many TV streaming apps (such as YouTube, Netflix, or Prime Video) build their own custom on-screen letter grid instead of using the OS virtual keyboard. Because spatial focus in these apps is placed on individual letter tiles rather than a text cursor, direct text injection is not routed to their search bar. Use the remote **D-Pad** (`Up`, `Down`, `Left`, `Right`, `OK`) to navigate and select letters on their custom grid.\n\n## Permissions\n\n`exec` — to run `/usr/bin/input_keyevent` for remote control keys and local text input, and to capture the frame buffer via Enlightenment D-Bus.\n\n## Commands it runs\n\n| Command | Why |\n| --- | --- |\n| `/usr/bin/input_keyevent <keysym> [down\\|up]` | Injects remote-control key events (D-pad, volume, channels, playback, system keys, digits) into the focused app |\n| `sh -c 'for k in ...; do /usr/bin/input_keyevent \"$k\"; sleep 0.04; done'` | Injects ASCII text directly via local TV key events |\n| `dbus-send --system --print-reply --dest=org.enlightenment.wm /org/enlightenment/wm org.enlightenment.wm.info.dump_screen string:'/tmp/screenshot.png'` | Captures a full-resolution 1080p frame buffer snapshot from the Enlightenment window manager |\n\n## Network\n\n| Host | Port | Protocol | Why |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| TV IP | `8002` | WSS (TLS, self-signed) | Samsung Remote WebSocket API (2019+ TVs) — injects full Unicode text in any language directly from the browser, and provides native hardware key press/release |\n| TV IP | `8001` | WS (plain HTTP) | Samsung Remote WebSocket API fallback (2016–2018 TVs) — unencrypted WebSocket that pairs without requiring browser SSL certificate approval |\n\n## Data it keeps\n\n`config.json` stores `{\"token\":\"...\"}` — the Samsung Remote API pairing token returned after the first connection to avoid repeated on-screen pairing prompts.\n\n## Screen Preview & Display Layers\n\nThe Screen Preview feature captures the TV's native graphics and OSD compositor plane (Enlightenment):\n- **What is captured:** Running apps (YouTube UI, streaming app homepages, browser pages), on-screen keyboards, search fields, channel banners, volume and input overlays, system dialogs, and settings menus.\n- **Hardware video overlay plane:** Broadcast TV (Satellite DVB-S2, Cable, Antenna) and protected HDMI inputs are decoded directly by the TV SoC's hardware video processing unit (VPU) on an isolated hardware overlay plane with broadcast DRM. The window manager punches a transparent hole (`alpha = 0`) in the graphics plane for this video to show through on the physical display panel, so screenshots capture this video viewport as transparent.\n\n## Keyboard shortcuts (when focused on page)\n\n| Key | Action |\n| --- | --- |\n| `Enter` | Send typed text to TV |\n| `Ctrl+Enter` | Send OK / confirm to TV |\n| `Backspace` on empty box | Send Backspace to TV |\n| `Escape` | Send Escape / Back to TV |\n| Arrow keys (held or pressed) | Move TV cursor / D-Pad |\n","index.js":"'use strict';\n\n// Vetro Shard: Keyboard & Remote\n//\n// Dual input architecture:\n//   1. Navigation, control keys & ASCII typing: executed directly on the TV via\n//      /usr/bin/input_keyevent (ctx.execute).\n//   2. Full Unicode (all languages): sent via Samsung Remote API WebSocket\n//      (wss://<tvIp>:8002) directly from the browser using pre-paired token.\n//\n// Continuous Key Repeat:\n//   - WebSocket mode: uses Samsung Remote \"Press\" and \"Release\" commands.\n//   - HTTP mode: TV-side hold timer (75ms) triggered by action: \"down\" / \"up\",\n//     eliminating network congestion.\n\nvar fs = require('fs');\nvar path = require('path');\n\nvar LATIN_MAP = {\n    ' ': 'space',\n    '.': 'period',\n    ',': 'comma',\n    '-': 'minus',\n    '_': 'underscore',\n    '/': 'slash',\n    ':': 'colon',\n    ';': 'semicolon',\n    '@': 'at',\n    '?': 'question',\n    '!': 'exclam',\n    '+': 'plus',\n    '=': 'equal',\n    '*': 'asterisk',\n    '(': 'parenleft',\n    ')': 'parenright',\n    '[': 'bracketleft',\n    ']': 'bracketright'\n};\n\nfunction charToKey(ch) {\n    if (/^[a-zA-Z0-9]$/.test(ch)) return ch;\n    if (LATIN_MAP[ch]) return LATIN_MAP[ch];\n    return null;\n}\n\nfunction loadPage(ctx) {\n    var places = [path.join(__dirname, 'ui.html'), path.join(ctx.dir || '', 'ui.html')];\n    for (var i = 0; i < places.length; i++) {\n        try { return fs.readFileSync(places[i], 'utf8'); } catch (e) { /* next */ }\n    }\n    return '<!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><p>Page file missing: reinstall this Shard.</p>';\n}\n\nmodule.exports = function (ctx) {\n\n    var page = null;\n    var activeHoldTimer = null;\n    var activeHoldKey = null;\n\n    function stopHold() {\n        if (activeHoldTimer) {\n            clearInterval(activeHoldTimer);\n            activeHoldTimer = null;\n        }\n        if (activeHoldKey) {\n            ctx.execute('/usr/bin/input_keyevent ' + activeHoldKey + ' up', 2000).catch(function () {});\n            activeHoldKey = null;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function startHold(key) {\n        stopHold();\n        activeHoldKey = key;\n        ctx.execute('/usr/bin/input_keyevent ' + key + ' down', 2000).catch(function () {});\n\n        var started = Date.now();\n        activeHoldTimer = setInterval(function () {\n            if (Date.now() - started > 6000 || activeHoldKey !== key) {\n                stopHold();\n                return;\n            }\n            ctx.execute('/usr/bin/input_keyevent ' + key, 2000).catch(function () {});\n        }, 75);\n    }\n\n    function getCfg() {\n        var c = ctx.config.get();\n        return (c && typeof c === 'object') ? c : {};\n    }\n\n    function saveCfg(c) {\n        ctx.config.set(c);\n    }\n\n    return {\n        start: function () {\n            page = loadPage(ctx);\n        },\n\n        stop: function () {\n            stopHold();\n            page = null;\n        },\n\n        status: function () {\n            var cfg = getCfg();\n            return { token: cfg.token || null };\n        },\n\n        route: function (req, res, sub) {\n\n            // GET api/ui\n            if (sub === 'ui' && req.method === 'GET') {\n                if (!page) page = loadPage(ctx);\n                res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'text/html; charset=utf-8', 'cache-control': 'no-store' });\n                res.end(page || '');\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            // GET api/status\n            if (sub === 'status' && req.method === 'GET') {\n                var cfg0 = getCfg();\n                res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: true, token: cfg0.token || null }));\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            // POST api/savetoken\n            if (sub === 'savetoken' && req.method === 'POST') {\n                var b = '';\n                req.on('data', function (c) { b += c; });\n                req.on('end', function () {\n                    var parsed;\n                    try { parsed = JSON.parse(b); } catch (e) { parsed = {}; }\n                    var c2 = getCfg();\n                    if (parsed.token) {\n                        c2.token = String(parsed.token);\n                    } else if (parsed.reset || parsed.token === null) {\n                        delete c2.token;\n                    }\n                    saveCfg(c2);\n                    res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                    res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: true }));\n                });\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            // POST api/key — inject single keysym or manage hold action\n            if (sub === 'key' && req.method === 'POST') {\n                var body = '';\n                req.on('data', function (c) { body += c; });\n                req.on('end', function () {\n                    var parsed, key, action;\n                    try {\n                        parsed = JSON.parse(body);\n                        key = parsed.key;\n                        action = parsed.action;\n                    } catch (e) {\n                        key = null;\n                        action = null;\n                    }\n                    if (!key || typeof key !== 'string' || !/^[A-Za-z0-9_]+$/.test(key)) {\n                        res.writeHead(400, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                        res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: 'invalid key name' }));\n                        return;\n                    }\n\n                    if (action === 'down') {\n                        startHold(key);\n                        res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                        res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: true, holding: true }));\n                        return;\n                    }\n\n                    if (action === 'up') {\n                        stopHold();\n                        res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                        res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: true, holding: false }));\n                        return;\n                    }\n\n                    // Single tap / click\n                    stopHold();\n                    ctx.execute('/usr/bin/input_keyevent ' + key, 5000)\n                        .then(function (r) {\n                            res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                            res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: r.exit_code === 0, stderr: r.stderr }));\n                        })\n                        .catch(function (e) {\n                            res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                            res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: e.message }));\n                        });\n                });\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            // POST api/type — inject ASCII string via input_keyevent sequence\n            if (sub === 'type' && req.method === 'POST') {\n                var btype = '';\n                req.on('data', function (c) { btype += c; });\n                req.on('end', function () {\n                    var parsed, text;\n                    try { parsed = JSON.parse(btype); text = parsed.text; } catch (e) { text = null; }\n                    if (!text || typeof text !== 'string') {\n                        res.writeHead(400, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                        res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: 'missing text' }));\n                        return;\n                    }\n                    var keys = [];\n                    for (var i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {\n                        var k = charToKey(text[i]);\n                        if (k) keys.push(k);\n                    }\n                    if (keys.length === 0) {\n                        res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                        res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: true }));\n                        return;\n                    }\n                    var cmd = \"sh -c 'for k in \" + keys.join(' ') + \"; do /usr/bin/input_keyevent \\\"$k\\\"; sleep 0.04; done'\";\n                    ctx.execute(cmd, 15000)\n                        .then(function (r) {\n                            res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                            res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: r.exit_code === 0, stderr: r.stderr }));\n                        })\n                        .catch(function (e) {\n                            res.writeHead(200, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                            res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: e.message }));\n                        });\n                });\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            // GET api/screenshot — captures 1080p frame buffer from Enlightenment WM\n            if (sub === 'screenshot' && req.method === 'GET') {\n                var shotPath = '/tmp/screenshot.png';\n                var shotCmd = \"dbus-send --system --print-reply --dest=org.enlightenment.wm /org/enlightenment/wm org.enlightenment.wm.info.dump_screen string:'\" + shotPath + \"'\";\n                ctx.execute(shotCmd, 10000)\n                    .then(function (r) {\n                        if (r.exit_code !== 0) {\n                            res.writeHead(500, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                            res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: r.stderr || 'Screenshot capture failed' }));\n                            return;\n                        }\n                        fs.readFile(shotPath, function (err, data) {\n                            if (err) {\n                                res.writeHead(500, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                                res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: err.message }));\n                                return;\n                            }\n                            res.writeHead(200, {\n                                'content-type': 'image/png',\n                                'cache-control': 'no-store, must-revalidate',\n                                'content-length': data.length\n                            });\n                            res.end(data);\n                        });\n                    })\n                    .catch(function (e) {\n                        res.writeHead(500, { 'content-type': 'application/json' });\n                        res.end(JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: e.message }));\n                    });\n                return true;\n            }\n\n            return false;\n        }\n    };\n};\n","ui.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\r\n<title>Keyboard &amp; Remote</title>\r\n<style>\r\n:root {\r\n  --bg: #0f1115;\r\n  --surface: #181b21;\r\n  --raised: #20242c;\r\n  --border: #2c323d;\r\n  --text: #e6edf3;\r\n  --muted: #8b949e;\r\n  --action: #58a6ff;\r\n  --action-hover: #79b8ff;\r\n  --danger: #f85149;\r\n  --danger-hover: #ff7b72;\r\n  --danger-soft: rgba(248, 81, 73, .12);\r\n  --danger-line: rgba(248, 81, 73, .35);\r\n  --warn: #d29922;\r\n  --warn-soft: rgba(210, 153, 34, .12);\r\n  --warn-line: rgba(210, 153, 34, .35);\r\n  --success: #3fb950;\r\n  --link: #58a6ff;\r\n  --focus: #388bfd;\r\n  --r: 8px;\r\n  --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n  --s1: 4px; --s2: 8px; --s3: 12px; --s4: 16px; --s5: 20px;\r\n  --fs-s: .85rem; --fs-m: .95rem; --fs-l: 1.1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\r\nbody {\r\n  font-family: var(--font);\r\n  background: var(--bg);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  padding: var(--s3);\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-m);\r\n  line-height: 1.4;\r\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.container {\r\n  max-width: 1200px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: var(--s3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.app-layout {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: var(--s3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (min-width: 860px) {\r\n  .app-layout {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, 1.25fr) minmax(280px, 1fr);\r\n    gap: var(--s3);\r\n    align-items: start;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n.col-main, .col-side {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: var(--s3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.box {\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  padding: var(--s3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.box-header {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.box-title-row {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.box-title-clickable {\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  user-select: none;\r\n}\r\n.box-title-row h2 {\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-l);\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.header-notice {\r\n  color: var(--muted);\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  line-height: 1.3;\r\n}\r\n.box-header-actions {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n  flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.status-badge {\r\n  font-size: .8rem;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  padding: 3px 10px;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--raised);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  color: var(--muted);\r\n}\r\n.status-badge.ok {\r\n  background: rgba(127, 203, 160, .14);\r\n  border-color: rgba(127, 203, 160, .4);\r\n  color: #7fcba0;\r\n}\r\n.status-badge.warn {\r\n  background: var(--warn-soft);\r\n  border-color: var(--warn-line);\r\n  color: var(--warn);\r\n}\r\n.status-badge.err {\r\n  background: var(--danger-soft);\r\n  border-color: var(--danger-line);\r\n  color: var(--danger);\r\n}\r\n.status-badge.busy {\r\n  background: rgba(143, 186, 255, .14);\r\n  border-color: rgba(143, 186, 255, .4);\r\n  color: var(--link);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-collapse {\r\n  width: 28px;\r\n  height: 28px;\r\n  min-height: 28px;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  background: var(--raised);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  color: var(--muted);\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  transition: background .15s, color .15s;\r\n}\r\n.btn-collapse:hover {\r\n  background: var(--border);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.btn-collapse svg {\r\n  width: 14px;\r\n  height: 14px;\r\n  fill: none;\r\n  stroke: currentColor;\r\n  stroke-width: 2.5;\r\n  stroke-linecap: round;\r\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\r\n  transition: transform .2s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#box-screen.is-collapsed .btn-collapse svg,\r\n#box-keyboard.is-collapsed .btn-collapse svg,\r\n#box-playback.is-collapsed .btn-collapse svg {\r\n  transform: rotate(-90deg);\r\n}\r\n#box-screen.is-collapsed #screen-body,\r\n#box-keyboard.is-collapsed #keyboard-body,\r\n#box-playback.is-collapsed #playback-body {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n#box-screen.is-collapsed,\r\n#box-keyboard.is-collapsed,\r\n#box-playback.is-collapsed {\r\n  padding-bottom: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n#box-screen.is-collapsed .box-header,\r\n#box-keyboard.is-collapsed .box-header,\r\n#box-playback.is-collapsed .box-header {\r\n  margin-bottom: 0;\r\n}\r\n#box-screen.is-collapsed .header-notice,\r\n#box-keyboard.is-collapsed .header-notice,\r\n#box-playback.is-collapsed .header-notice {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notice {\r\n  color: var(--muted);\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.kbd {\r\n  display: inline-block;\r\n  padding: 1px 5px;\r\n  background: var(--raised);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 4px;\r\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\r\n  font-size: .8rem;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.sec {\r\n  font-size: .75rem;\r\n  letter-spacing: .08em;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  color: var(--muted);\r\n  margin-top: var(--s3);\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n\r\nbutton {\r\n  background: var(--raised);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-family: inherit;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  padding: var(--s2) var(--s3);\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  gap: var(--s1);\r\n  min-height: 40px;\r\n  touch-action: manipulation;\r\n  user-select: none;\r\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\r\n  transition: background .12s, border-color .12s, transform .05s;\r\n}\r\nbutton:hover { background: #262b34; border-color: #3b4250; }\r\nbutton:active { background: #1c2027; transform: scale(.98); }\r\nbutton:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 1px; }\r\n\r\nbutton.primary {\r\n  background: var(--action);\r\n  color: #0b1118;\r\n  border-color: var(--action);\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\nbutton.primary:hover { background: var(--action-hover); border-color: var(--action-hover); }\r\n\r\nbutton.danger {\r\n  background: var(--danger-soft);\r\n  color: var(--danger);\r\n  border-color: var(--danger-line);\r\n}\r\nbutton.danger:hover { background: rgba(248, 81, 73, .22); }\r\n\r\n.input-row {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n  align-items: stretch;\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.input-row input {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  background: var(--bg);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-family: inherit;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-m);\r\n  padding: var(--s2) var(--s3);\r\n  min-height: 40px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.input-row input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: -1px; }\r\n.input-btns {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: var(--s1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n#cert-banner {\r\n  display: none;\r\n  background: var(--warn-soft);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--warn-line);\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  padding: var(--s3);\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s3);\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n}\r\n.cert-url-bar {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: var(--s1);\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.cert-url-bar input {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  background: var(--bg);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: .8rem;\r\n  padding: 4px 8px;\r\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\r\n}\r\n.cert-btn-bar {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: var(--s1);\r\n}\r\n.cert-btn-bar button, .cert-btn-bar a button {\r\n  min-height: 32px;\r\n  padding: 4px 10px;\r\n  font-size: .8rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dpad-cluster {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n  max-width: 340px;\r\n  margin: var(--s2) auto var(--s3);\r\n}\r\n.dpad-cluster button {\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-m);\r\n}\r\n.dpad-ok {\r\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.rocker-section {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n  margin-bottom: var(--s3);\r\n  max-width: 340px;\r\n  margin-left: auto;\r\n  margin-right: auto;\r\n  align-items: stretch;\r\n}\r\n.rocker-pill {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  background: var(--bg);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  padding: var(--s1);\r\n  gap: var(--s1);\r\n  align-items: stretch;\r\n}\r\n.rocker-pill button {\r\n  height: 40px;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-m);\r\n}\r\n.rocker-tag {\r\n  font-size: .7rem;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: var(--muted);\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  padding: 2px 0;\r\n  letter-spacing: .05em;\r\n}\r\n.center-stack {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  height: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.center-stack button {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-height: 40px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.grid-4 {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n@media (min-width: 480px) {\r\n  .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\r\n}\r\n.grid-4 button {\r\n  height: 40px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.numpad {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n  max-width: 260px;\r\n  margin: var(--s2) auto 0;\r\n}\r\n.numpad button {\r\n  height: 44px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-l);\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.media-grid {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.media-grid button {\r\n  height: 42px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.color-grid {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n@media (min-width: 480px) {\r\n  .color-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\r\n}\r\n.color-grid button {\r\n  height: 40px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n}\r\n.btn-red { border-left: 4px solid #f85149; }\r\n.btn-green { border-left: 4px solid #3fb950; }\r\n.btn-yellow { border-left: 4px solid #d29922; }\r\n.btn-blue { border-left: 4px solid #58a6ff; }\r\n\r\n.screen-frame {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\r\n  background: #000;\r\n  border-radius: var(--r);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n}\r\n.screen-frame img {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  height: 100%;\r\n  object-fit: contain;\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n.screen-controls {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  margin-top: var(--s2);\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: var(--s2);\r\n}\r\n.screen-info-group {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: var(--s3);\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.auto-refresh-label {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  font-size: var(--fs-s);\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  user-select: none;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.auto-refresh-label input {\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  width: 15px;\r\n  height: 15px;\r\n  accent-color: var(--action);\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <!-- Section: Screen Preview (Full width at top, collapsible) -->\r\n  <div id=\"box-screen\" class=\"box is-collapsed\">\r\n    <div class=\"box-header\">\r\n      <div class=\"box-title-row box-title-clickable\" id=\"screen-header\">\r\n        <h2>Screen preview</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"box-header-actions\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-collapse\" id=\"btn-toggle-screen\" title=\"Toggle Screen Preview\" aria-label=\"Toggle Screen Preview\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <p class=\"header-notice\">Live screen preview from the TV. Captures the current display for headless control.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div id=\"screen-body\">\r\n      <div class=\"screen-frame\">\r\n        <img id=\"screen-img\" src=\"\" alt=\"TV Screen\">\r\n        <div id=\"screen-spinner\" style=\"display:none;padding:var(--s5);text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:var(--fs-s)\">Capturing screen from TV…</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"screen-controls\">\r\n        <div class=\"screen-info-group\">\r\n          <span id=\"screen-time\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-s);color:var(--muted)\"></span>\r\n          <label class=\"auto-refresh-label\">\r\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk-auto-refresh\">\r\n            <span>Auto-refresh</span>\r\n          </label>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-refresh-screen\" class=\"primary\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-s);padding:4px 12px\">🔄 Capture / Refresh</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"app-layout\">\r\n    <!-- Column 1: Controls (Keyboard, Remote, Numpad) -->\r\n    <div class=\"col-main\">\r\n      <!-- Section 1: Keyboard Input (Collapsible) -->\r\n      <div id=\"box-keyboard\" class=\"box\">\r\n        <div class=\"box-header\">\r\n          <div class=\"box-title-row box-title-clickable\" id=\"keyboard-header\">\r\n            <h2>Keyboard input</h2>\r\n            <div class=\"box-header-actions\">\r\n              <div id=\"status\" class=\"status-badge busy\">Connecting…</div>\r\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-collapse\" id=\"btn-toggle-keyboard\" title=\"Toggle Keyboard input\" aria-label=\"Toggle Keyboard input\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <p class=\"header-notice\">Type text into the focused field on the TV (YouTube, browser, apps). Supports any language.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"keyboard-body\">\r\n          <div id=\"cert-banner\">\r\n            <div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:var(--s1)\">⚠️ TV Permission for port 8002</div>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size:var(--fs-s);color:var(--text);margin-bottom:var(--s2)\">\r\n              To enable direct Unicode typing, open this URL in a new browser tab and tap <strong>Advanced → Proceed</strong>:\r\n            </p>\r\n            <div class=\"cert-url-bar\">\r\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"cert-url\" readonly>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"cert-btn-bar\">\r\n              <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-copy-cert\" class=\"primary\">📋 Copy URL</button>\r\n              <a id=\"cert-link\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><button type=\"button\">Open ↗</button></a>\r\n              <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-reconnect\">🔄 Reconnect</button>\r\n              <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-repair\">Reset Pairing</button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:var(--s2);margin-bottom:0\">\r\n              <em>Tip:</em> If the button doesn't open a tab due to Vetro's iframe sandbox, tap <strong>Copy URL</strong> and paste into your browser's address bar. Then return here and tap <strong>Reconnect</strong>.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"input-row\">\r\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"ti\" placeholder=\"Type text here…\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n            <div class=\"input-btns\">\r\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" id=\"btn-send\">Send ↵</button>\r\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"danger\" id=\"btn-bksp\">⌫ Del</button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <p class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">\r\n            <span class=\"kbd\">Enter</span> — send &nbsp;·&nbsp;\r\n            <span class=\"kbd\">Ctrl+Enter</span> — OK &nbsp;·&nbsp;\r\n            <span class=\"kbd\">Backspace</span> on empty — TV delete\r\n          </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Section 2: Remote Control & Navigation -->\r\n      <div id=\"box-remote\" class=\"box\">\r\n        <div class=\"box-header\">\r\n          <div class=\"box-title-row\">\r\n            <h2>Remote control</h2>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <p class=\"header-notice\">Ergonomic directional pad and quick controls. Hold buttons for continuous scrolling.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- D-Pad Directional Cluster -->\r\n        <div class=\"dpad-cluster\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Home\" title=\"Home\">⌂ Home</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"Up\" aria-label=\"Up\">▲</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Back\" title=\"Back\">↩ Back</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"Left\" aria-label=\"Left\">◀</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"primary dpad-ok\" data-key=\"Return\">OK</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"Right\" aria-label=\"Right\">▶</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Menu\" title=\"Menu\">☰ Menu</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"Down\" aria-label=\"Down\">▼</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Exit\" title=\"Exit\">✕ Exit</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Volume & Channel Rockers -->\r\n        <div class=\"rocker-section\">\r\n          <div class=\"rocker-pill\">\r\n            <span class=\"rocker-tag\">VOL</span>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioRaiseVolume\" title=\"Volume Up\">＋</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioMute\" title=\"Mute\">🔇</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioLowerVolume\" title=\"Volume Down\">－</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"center-stack\">\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Info\">ℹ Info</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86ChannelGuide\">📅 Guide</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86ChannelList\">📋 Channels</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"rocker-pill\">\r\n            <span class=\"rocker-tag\">CH</span>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86RaiseChannel\" title=\"Channel Up\">▲</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86PreviousChannel\" title=\"Previous Channel\">⤾</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86LowerChannel\" title=\"Channel Down\">▼</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"sec\">System &amp; Display</p>\r\n        <div class=\"grid-4\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"danger\" data-key=\"XF86PowerOff\">⏻ Power</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86TV\">📺 Source</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86QuickMenu\">⚙ Quick</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Search\">🔍 Search</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Subtitle\">💬 Subtitle</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86MultiView\">📱 MultiView</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86PictureSize\">📐 Aspect</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Ambient\">🖼 Ambient</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Column 2: Display & Playback (Playback & Colors, Number Pad) -->\r\n    <div class=\"col-side\">\r\n      <!-- Section 3: Playback & Colors (Collapsible) -->\r\n      <div id=\"box-playback\" class=\"box\">\r\n        <div class=\"box-header\">\r\n          <div class=\"box-title-row box-title-clickable\" id=\"playback-header\">\r\n            <h2>Playback &amp; Colors</h2>\r\n            <div class=\"box-header-actions\">\r\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-collapse\" id=\"btn-toggle-playback\" title=\"Toggle Playback & Colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Playback & Colors\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"playback-body\">\r\n          <div class=\"media-grid\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s3)\">\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioRewind\">⏪ Rew</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioPlayPause\">⏯ P/P</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioForward\">⏩ FF</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86PreviousChapter\">⏮ Prev</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioStop\">⏹ Stop</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86NextChapter\">⏭ Next</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioPause\">⏸ Pause</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioPlay\" class=\"primary\">▶ Play</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86AudioRecord\">⏺ Rec</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <p class=\"sec\" style=\"margin-top:0\">Color Keys</p>\r\n          <div class=\"color-grid\">\r\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-red\" data-key=\"XF86Red\">🔴 Red</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-green\" data-key=\"XF86Green\">🟢 Green</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-yellow\" data-key=\"XF86Yellow\">🟡 Yellow</button>\r\n            <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"XF86Blue\">🔵 Blue</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Section 4: Number Pad -->\r\n      <div id=\"box-numpad\" class=\"box\">\r\n        <div class=\"box-header\">\r\n          <div class=\"box-title-row\">\r\n            <h2>Number pad</h2>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"numpad\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"1\">1</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"2\">2</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"3\">3</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"4\">4</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"5\">5</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"6\">6</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"7\">7</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"8\">8</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"9\">9</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"minus\">−</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"0\">0</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" data-key=\"BackSpace\">⌫</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nvar tvIp = location.hostname || \"127.0.0.1\";\r\nvar tvToken = null;\r\nvar ws = null;\r\nvar wsConnected = false;\r\nvar wsConnecting = false;\r\nvar activePort = null;\r\nvar activeHoldKey = null;\r\n\r\nvar isTouch = (\"ontouchstart\" in window) || (navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0);\r\n\r\nvar statusEl = document.getElementById(\"status\");\r\nvar ti = document.getElementById(\"ti\");\r\nvar certBanner = document.getElementById(\"cert-banner\");\r\nvar certLink = document.getElementById(\"cert-link\");\r\nvar certUrlInput = document.getElementById(\"cert-url\");\r\nvar btnCopyCert = document.getElementById(\"btn-copy-cert\");\r\nvar btnReconnect = document.getElementById(\"btn-reconnect\");\r\nvar btnRepair = document.getElementById(\"btn-repair\");\r\n\r\n// Prevent mobile virtual keyboard from reappearing when tapping remote buttons or background\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function (e) {\r\n  if (e.target && e.target !== ti && !e.target.closest(\"#box-keyboard\")) {\r\n    if (document.activeElement === ti) {\r\n      ti.blur();\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}, true);\r\n\r\nvar fullCertUrl = \"https://\" + tvIp + \":8002/api/v2/\";\r\nif (certUrlInput) certUrlInput.value = fullCertUrl;\r\nif (certLink) certLink.href = fullCertUrl;\r\n\r\nif (btnCopyCert) {\r\n  btnCopyCert.onclick = function () {\r\n    if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\r\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(fullCertUrl).then(function () {\r\n        btnCopyCert.textContent = \"✔ Copied!\";\r\n        setTimeout(function () { btnCopyCert.textContent = \"📋 Copy URL\"; }, 2500);\r\n      }).catch(function () {\r\n        certUrlInput.select();\r\n        document.execCommand(\"copy\");\r\n        btnCopyCert.textContent = \"✔ Copied!\";\r\n        setTimeout(function () { btnCopyCert.textContent = \"📋 Copy URL\"; }, 2500);\r\n      });\r\n    } else {\r\n      certUrlInput.select();\r\n      document.execCommand(\"copy\");\r\n      btnCopyCert.textContent = \"✔ Copied!\";\r\n      setTimeout(function () { btnCopyCert.textContent = \"📋 Copy URL\"; }, 2500);\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (btnReconnect) {\r\n  btnReconnect.onclick = function () {\r\n    setStatus(\"Connecting…\", \"busy\");\r\n    if (ws) { try { ws.close(); } catch (e) {} }\r\n    wsConnected = false;\r\n    wsConnecting = false;\r\n    initWS();\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (btnRepair) {\r\n  btnRepair.onclick = function () {\r\n    tvToken = null;\r\n    fetch(\"savetoken\", {\r\n      method: \"POST\",\r\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n      body: JSON.stringify({ reset: true })\r\n    }).then(function () {\r\n      setStatus(\"Pairing reset. Reconnecting…\", \"busy\");\r\n      if (ws) { try { ws.close(); } catch (e) {} }\r\n      wsConnected = false;\r\n      wsConnecting = false;\r\n      initWS();\r\n    });\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (certLink) {\r\n  certLink.onclick = function (e) {\r\n    var opened = null;\r\n    try {\r\n      opened = window.open(fullCertUrl, \"_blank\");\r\n    } catch (err) {}\r\n    if (!opened) {\r\n      e.preventDefault();\r\n      if (btnCopyCert) btnCopyCert.click();\r\n      setStatus(\"Sandbox blocked popup. URL copied — paste in a new browser tab!\", \"warn\");\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction setStatus(msg, cls) {\r\n  statusEl.textContent = msg;\r\n  statusEl.className = \"status-badge\" + (cls ? \" \" + cls : \"\");\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction utf8b64(str) {\r\n  return btoa(unescape(encodeURIComponent(str)));\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Repeatable keys that benefit from continuous hold\r\nvar REPEAT_KEYS = {\r\n  \"Up\": true, \"Down\": true, \"Left\": true, \"Right\": true,\r\n  \"XF86AudioRaiseVolume\": true, \"XF86AudioLowerVolume\": true,\r\n  \"XF86RaiseChannel\": true, \"XF86LowerChannel\": true,\r\n  \"BackSpace\": true\r\n};\r\n\r\n// Samsung Remote WebSocket API key names (universal across 2016-2024+ Samsung TVs)\r\nvar WS_KEY_MAP = {\r\n  // Navigation & Core\r\n  \"Up\": \"KEY_UP\", \"Down\": \"KEY_DOWN\", \"Left\": \"KEY_LEFT\", \"Right\": \"KEY_RIGHT\",\r\n  \"Return\": \"KEY_ENTER\", \"XF86Home\": \"KEY_HOME\", \"XF86Back\": \"KEY_RETURN\",\r\n  \"XF86Exit\": \"KEY_EXIT\", \"XF86Menu\": \"KEY_MENU\", \"XF86Info\": \"KEY_INFO\",\r\n  // Volume & Audio\r\n  \"XF86AudioRaiseVolume\": \"KEY_VOLUP\", \"XF86AudioLowerVolume\": \"KEY_VOLDOWN\", \"XF86AudioMute\": \"KEY_MUTE\",\r\n  // Channels\r\n  \"XF86RaiseChannel\": \"KEY_CHUP\", \"XF86LowerChannel\": \"KEY_CHDOWN\",\r\n  \"XF86PreviousChannel\": \"KEY_PRECH\", \"XF86ChannelList\": \"KEY_CH_LIST\", \"XF86ChannelGuide\": \"KEY_GUIDE\",\r\n  // Media Playback\r\n  \"XF86AudioRewind\": \"KEY_REWIND\",\r\n  \"XF86AudioPlay\": \"KEY_PLAY\", \"XF86AudioPause\": \"KEY_PAUSE\", \"XF86AudioPlayPause\": \"KEY_PLAY_BACK\",\r\n  \"XF86AudioStop\": \"KEY_STOP\", \"XF86AudioForward\": \"KEY_FF\", \"XF86AudioRecord\": \"KEY_REC\",\r\n  // Color Keys (Samsung standard uses KEY_CYAN for Blue)\r\n  \"XF86Red\": \"KEY_RED\", \"XF86Green\": \"KEY_GREEN\", \"XF86Yellow\": \"KEY_YELLOW\", \"XF86Blue\": \"KEY_CYAN\",\r\n  // System & Extra\r\n  \"XF86PowerOff\": \"KEY_POWER\", \"XF86TV\": \"KEY_SOURCE\", \"XF86DiscretSourceTV\": \"KEY_SOURCE\",\r\n  \"XF86QuickMenu\": \"KEY_TOOLS\", \"XF86Search\": \"KEY_SEARCH\", \"XF86Subtitle\": \"KEY_SUB_TITLE\",\r\n  \"XF86MultiView\": \"KEY_MULTI_VIEW\", \"XF86PictureSize\": \"KEY_ASPECT\", \"XF86Ambient\": \"KEY_AMBIENT\",\r\n  // Digits\r\n  \"0\": \"KEY_0\", \"1\": \"KEY_1\", \"2\": \"KEY_2\", \"3\": \"KEY_3\", \"4\": \"KEY_4\",\r\n  \"5\": \"KEY_5\", \"6\": \"KEY_6\", \"7\": \"KEY_7\", \"8\": \"KEY_8\", \"9\": \"KEY_9\",\r\n  \"minus\": \"KEY_MINUS\"\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction pressDown(key) {\r\n  if (document.activeElement === ti) {\r\n    ti.blur();\r\n  }\r\n  if (!key || activeHoldKey === key) return;\r\n  activeHoldKey = key;\r\n  if (wsConnected && ws && ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN && WS_KEY_MAP[key]) {\r\n    try {\r\n      ws.send(JSON.stringify({\r\n        method: \"ms.remote.control\",\r\n        params: { Cmd: \"Press\", DataOfCmd: WS_KEY_MAP[key], Option: \"false\", TypeOfRemote: \"SendRemoteKey\" }\r\n      }));\r\n      return;\r\n    } catch (e) { wsConnected = false; }\r\n  }\r\n  fetch(\"key\", {\r\n    method: \"POST\",\r\n    headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n    body: JSON.stringify({ key: key, action: \"down\" })\r\n  }).catch(function () {});\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction releaseUp(key) {\r\n  var k = key || activeHoldKey;\r\n  if (!k) return;\r\n  activeHoldKey = null;\r\n  if (wsConnected && ws && ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN && WS_KEY_MAP[k]) {\r\n    try {\r\n      ws.send(JSON.stringify({\r\n        method: \"ms.remote.control\",\r\n        params: { Cmd: \"Release\", DataOfCmd: WS_KEY_MAP[k], Option: \"false\", TypeOfRemote: \"SendRemoteKey\" }\r\n      }));\r\n      return;\r\n    } catch (e) { wsConnected = false; }\r\n  }\r\n  fetch(\"key\", {\r\n    method: \"POST\",\r\n    headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n    body: JSON.stringify({ key: k, action: \"up\" })\r\n  }).catch(function () {});\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction sendKey(key) {\r\n  if (document.activeElement === ti) {\r\n    ti.blur();\r\n  }\r\n  if (!key) return Promise.resolve();\r\n  if (wsConnected && ws && ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN && WS_KEY_MAP[key]) {\r\n    try {\r\n      ws.send(JSON.stringify({\r\n        method: \"ms.remote.control\",\r\n        params: { Cmd: \"Click\", DataOfCmd: WS_KEY_MAP[key], Option: \"false\", TypeOfRemote: \"SendRemoteKey\" }\r\n      }));\r\n      return Promise.resolve();\r\n    } catch (e) { wsConnected = false; }\r\n  }\r\n  return fetch(\"key\", {\r\n    method: \"POST\",\r\n    headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n    body: JSON.stringify({ key: key })\r\n  }).then(function (r) { return r.json(); })\r\n    .then(function (d) {\r\n      if (!d.ok) setStatus(\"Failed: \" + (d.error || d.stderr || \"\"), \"err\");\r\n    })\r\n    .catch(function () { setStatus(\"Network error\", \"err\"); });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction initWS(forcePort) {\r\n  if (wsConnected) return;\r\n  if (wsConnecting && !forcePort) return;\r\n  wsConnecting = true;\r\n\r\n  var port = forcePort || activePort || 8002;\r\n  var isSecure = (port === 8002);\r\n  var proto = isSecure ? \"wss://\" : \"ws://\";\r\n  var appB64 = btoa(\"TVKeyboard\");\r\n  var url = proto + tvIp + \":\" + port + \"/api/v2/channels/samsung.remote.control?name=\" + appB64 +\r\n            (tvToken ? \"&token=\" + encodeURIComponent(tvToken) : \"\");\r\n\r\n  var currentWs;\r\n  try {\r\n    currentWs = new WebSocket(url);\r\n    ws = currentWs;\r\n  } catch (e) {\r\n    wsConnecting = false;\r\n    wsConnected = false;\r\n    if (port === 8002) {\r\n      setTimeout(function () { initWS(8001); }, 100);\r\n    }\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  var opened = false;\r\n  var connTimer = setTimeout(function () {\r\n    if (!opened && wsConnecting && ws === currentWs) {\r\n      try { currentWs.close(); } catch (e) {}\r\n      wsConnecting = false;\r\n      if (port === 8002) {\r\n        initWS(8001);\r\n      } else {\r\n        certBanner.style.display = \"block\";\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }, 3000);\r\n\r\n  currentWs.onopen = function () {\r\n    opened = true;\r\n    clearTimeout(connTimer);\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  currentWs.onmessage = function (e) {\r\n    try {\r\n      var msg = JSON.parse(e.data);\r\n      if (msg.event === \"ms.channel.connect\") {\r\n        wsConnected = true;\r\n        wsConnecting = false;\r\n        activePort = port;\r\n        var t = msg.data && msg.data.token ? String(msg.data.token) : null;\r\n        if (t && t !== tvToken) {\r\n          tvToken = t;\r\n          fetch(\"savetoken\", {\r\n            method: \"POST\",\r\n            headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n            body: JSON.stringify({ token: t })\r\n          }).catch(function () {});\r\n        }\r\n        setStatus(\"Connected ✔ Ready\", \"ok\");\r\n        certBanner.style.display = \"none\";\r\n      } else if (msg.event === \"ms.channel.unauthorized\") {\r\n        wsConnected = false;\r\n        wsConnecting = false;\r\n        tvToken = null;\r\n        fetch(\"savetoken\", {\r\n          method: \"POST\",\r\n          headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n          body: JSON.stringify({ reset: true })\r\n        }).catch(function () {});\r\n        setStatus(\"Pairing required — please select 'Allow' on your TV screen\", \"warn\");\r\n        setTimeout(function () { initWS(port); }, 1500);\r\n      }\r\n    } catch (err) {}\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  currentWs.onerror = function () {\r\n    clearTimeout(connTimer);\r\n    wsConnected = false;\r\n    wsConnecting = false;\r\n    if (!opened && port === 8002) {\r\n      initWS(8001);\r\n    } else if (!opened) {\r\n      certBanner.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  currentWs.onclose = function () {\r\n    clearTimeout(connTimer);\r\n    wsConnected = false;\r\n    wsConnecting = false;\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfetch(\"status\").then(function (r) { return r.json(); }).then(function (d) {\r\n  if (d.token) tvToken = d.token;\r\n  initWS();\r\n}).catch(function () {\r\n  initWS();\r\n});\r\n\r\nvar SPECIAL = {\r\n  ArrowUp: \"Up\", ArrowDown: \"Down\", ArrowLeft: \"Left\", ArrowRight: \"Right\",\r\n  Backspace: \"BackSpace\", Escape: \"Escape\"\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction sendText(text) {\r\n  if (!text) return;\r\n  var isAscii = /^[\\x20-\\x7E]*$/.test(text);\r\n\r\n  if (wsConnected && ws && ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {\r\n    setStatus(\"Sending text…\", \"busy\");\r\n    try {\r\n      ws.send(JSON.stringify({\r\n        method: \"ms.remote.control\",\r\n        params: {\r\n          Cmd: utf8b64(text),\r\n          DataOfCmd: \"base64\",\r\n          TypeOfRemote: \"SendInputString\"\r\n        }\r\n      }));\r\n      setStatus(\"Text sent ✔\", \"ok\");\r\n      return;\r\n    } catch (e) {\r\n      wsConnected = false;\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  if (isAscii) {\r\n    setStatus(\"Typing on TV…\", \"busy\");\r\n    fetch(\"type\", {\r\n      method: \"POST\",\r\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\r\n      body: JSON.stringify({ text: text })\r\n    }).then(function (r) { return r.json(); })\r\n      .then(function (d) {\r\n        setStatus(d.ok ? \"Text sent ✔\" : \"Failed: \" + (d.error || \"\"), d.ok ? \"ok\" : \"err\");\r\n      })\r\n      .catch(function () { setStatus(\"Network error\", \"err\"); });\r\n  } else {\r\n    certBanner.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    setStatus(\"Unicode text input requires TV certificate approval (see banner above)\", \"warn\");\r\n    initWS();\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Auto RTL text direction for right-to-left scripts\r\nvar RTL_REGEX = /[\\u0591-\\u07FF\\uFB1D-\\uFDFD\\uFE70-\\uFEFC]/;\r\nti.addEventListener(\"input\", function () {\r\n  ti.dir = RTL_REGEX.test(ti.value) ? \"rtl\" : \"ltr\";\r\n});\r\n\r\nti.addEventListener(\"keydown\", function (e) {\r\n  if (e.key === \"Enter\" && !e.ctrlKey) {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    var t = ti.value; ti.value = \"\"; ti.dir = \"ltr\";\r\n    sendText(t);\r\n    if (isTouch) ti.blur();\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  if (e.key === \"Enter\" && e.ctrlKey) {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    sendKey(\"Return\");\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  if (e.key === \"Backspace\" && ti.value === \"\") {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    if (e.repeat) return;\r\n    pressDown(\"BackSpace\");\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    sendKey(\"Escape\");\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  if ((e.key === \"ArrowUp\" || e.key === \"ArrowDown\" || e.key === \"ArrowLeft\" || e.key === \"ArrowRight\") && !e.ctrlKey) {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    if (e.repeat) return;\r\n    pressDown(SPECIAL[e.key]);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n\r\nti.addEventListener(\"keyup\", function (e) {\r\n  if (e.key === \"Backspace\" && activeHoldKey === \"BackSpace\") {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    releaseUp(\"BackSpace\");\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  if (SPECIAL[e.key] && activeHoldKey === SPECIAL[e.key]) {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    releaseUp(SPECIAL[e.key]);\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\"keydown\", function (e) {\r\n  if (document.activeElement === ti) return;\r\n  var key = SPECIAL[e.key];\r\n  if (key) {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    if (e.repeat) return;\r\n    if (REPEAT_KEYS[key]) {\r\n      pressDown(key);\r\n    } else {\r\n      sendKey(key);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\"keyup\", function (e) {\r\n  if (document.activeElement === ti) return;\r\n  var key = SPECIAL[e.key];\r\n  if (key && activeHoldKey === key) {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    releaseUp(key);\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n\r\nwindow.addEventListener(\"blur\", function () {\r\n  if (activeHoldKey) releaseUp();\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById(\"btn-send\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\r\n  var t = ti.value; ti.value = \"\"; ti.dir = \"ltr\";\r\n  sendText(t);\r\n  if (!isTouch) {\r\n    ti.focus();\r\n  } else {\r\n    ti.blur();\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n\r\nvar btnBksp = document.getElementById(\"btn-bksp\");\r\nbtnBksp.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function (e) {\r\n  e.preventDefault();\r\n  pressDown(\"BackSpace\");\r\n});\r\nbtnBksp.addEventListener(\"pointerup\", function (e) {\r\n  e.preventDefault();\r\n  releaseUp(\"BackSpace\");\r\n  if (!isTouch) ti.focus();\r\n});\r\nbtnBksp.addEventListener(\"pointerleave\", function (e) {\r\n  if (activeHoldKey === \"BackSpace\") releaseUp(\"BackSpace\");\r\n});\r\nbtnBksp.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\", function (e) {\r\n  if (activeHoldKey === \"BackSpace\") releaseUp(\"BackSpace\");\r\n});\r\n\r\nvar keyButtons = document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-key]\");\r\nfor (var i = 0; i < keyButtons.length; i++) {\r\n  (function (btn) {\r\n    var k = btn.getAttribute(\"data-key\");\r\n    if (REPEAT_KEYS[k]) {\r\n      btn.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function (e) {\r\n        e.preventDefault();\r\n        pressDown(k);\r\n      });\r\n      btn.addEventListener(\"pointerup\", function (e) {\r\n        e.preventDefault();\r\n        releaseUp(k);\r\n      });\r\n      btn.addEventListener(\"pointerleave\", function (e) {\r\n        if (activeHoldKey === k) releaseUp(k);\r\n      });\r\n      btn.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\", function (e) {\r\n        if (activeHoldKey === k) releaseUp(k);\r\n      });\r\n    } else {\r\n      btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\r\n        sendKey(k);\r\n      });\r\n    }\r\n  })(keyButtons[i]);\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Collapsible cards handling\r\nvar boxKeyboard = document.getElementById(\"box-keyboard\");\r\nvar btnToggleKeyboard = document.getElementById(\"btn-toggle-keyboard\");\r\nvar keyboardHeader = document.getElementById(\"keyboard-header\");\r\n\r\nfunction toggleKeyboardCollapse(e) {\r\n  if (e && e.target && (e.target.closest(\"#status\") || e.target.closest(\"a\") || e.target.closest(\"input\"))) return;\r\n  var collapsed = boxKeyboard.classList.toggle(\"is-collapsed\");\r\n  btnToggleKeyboard.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", collapsed ? \"false\" : \"true\");\r\n  try {\r\n    localStorage.setItem(\"vetro_keyboard_collapsed\", collapsed ? \"1\" : \"0\");\r\n  } catch (err) {}\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (btnToggleKeyboard && boxKeyboard) {\r\n  btnToggleKeyboard.addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\r\n    e.stopPropagation();\r\n    toggleKeyboardCollapse();\r\n  });\r\n  if (keyboardHeader) {\r\n    keyboardHeader.addEventListener(\"click\", toggleKeyboardCollapse);\r\n  }\r\n  try {\r\n    if (localStorage.getItem(\"vetro_keyboard_collapsed\") === \"1\") {\r\n      boxKeyboard.classList.add(\"is-collapsed\");\r\n      btnToggleKeyboard.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"false\");\r\n    }\r\n  } catch (err) {}\r\n}\r\n\r\nvar boxPlayback = document.getElementById(\"box-playback\");\r\nvar btnTogglePlayback = document.getElementById(\"btn-toggle-playback\");\r\nvar playbackHeader = document.getElementById(\"playback-header\");\r\n\r\nfunction togglePlaybackCollapse(e) {\r\n  if (e && e.target && (e.target.closest(\"a\") || e.target.closest(\"button:not(.btn-collapse)\"))) return;\r\n  var collapsed = boxPlayback.classList.toggle(\"is-collapsed\");\r\n  btnTogglePlayback.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", collapsed ? \"false\" : \"true\");\r\n  try {\r\n    localStorage.setItem(\"vetro_playback_collapsed\", collapsed ? \"1\" : \"0\");\r\n  } catch (err) {}\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (btnTogglePlayback && boxPlayback) {\r\n  btnTogglePlayback.addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\r\n    e.stopPropagation();\r\n    togglePlaybackCollapse();\r\n  });\r\n  if (playbackHeader) {\r\n    playbackHeader.addEventListener(\"click\", togglePlaybackCollapse);\r\n  }\r\n  try {\r\n    if (localStorage.getItem(\"vetro_playback_collapsed\") === \"1\") {\r\n      boxPlayback.classList.add(\"is-collapsed\");\r\n      btnTogglePlayback.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"false\");\r\n    }\r\n  } catch (err) {}\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Screen preview logic\r\nvar boxScreen = document.getElementById(\"box-screen\");\r\nvar btnToggleScreen = document.getElementById(\"btn-toggle-screen\");\r\nvar screenHeader = document.getElementById(\"screen-header\");\r\nvar screenImg = document.getElementById(\"screen-img\");\r\nvar screenSpinner = document.getElementById(\"screen-spinner\");\r\nvar screenTime = document.getElementById(\"screen-time\");\r\nvar btnRefreshScreen = document.getElementById(\"btn-refresh-screen\");\r\nvar chkAutoRefresh = document.getElementById(\"chk-auto-refresh\");\r\nvar screenCapturing = false;\r\nvar autoRefreshTimer = null;\r\n\r\nfunction fetchScreenshot() {\r\n  if (screenCapturing) return;\r\n  screenCapturing = true;\r\n  if (!screenImg.src || screenImg.style.display === \"none\") {\r\n    screenSpinner.textContent = \"Capturing screen from TV…\";\r\n    screenSpinner.style.display = \"block\";\r\n  } else {\r\n    screenTime.textContent = \"Updating preview…\";\r\n  }\r\n  btnRefreshScreen.disabled = true;\r\n  btnRefreshScreen.textContent = \"⏳ Capturing…\";\r\n\r\n  var img = new Image();\r\n  var url = \"screenshot?t=\" + Date.now();\r\n  img.onload = function () {\r\n    screenImg.src = url;\r\n    screenImg.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    screenSpinner.style.display = \"none\";\r\n    screenCapturing = false;\r\n    btnRefreshScreen.disabled = false;\r\n    btnRefreshScreen.textContent = \"🔄 Capture / Refresh\";\r\n    var d = new Date();\r\n    var pad = function (n) { return (n < 10 ? \"0\" : \"\") + n; };\r\n    screenTime.textContent = \"Captured at \" + pad(d.getHours()) + \":\" + pad(d.getMinutes()) + \":\" + pad(d.getSeconds());\r\n\r\n    if (chkAutoRefresh && chkAutoRefresh.checked && !boxScreen.classList.contains(\"is-collapsed\")) {\r\n      autoRefreshTimer = setTimeout(fetchScreenshot, 3500);\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n  img.onerror = function () {\r\n    if (!screenImg.src || screenImg.style.display === \"none\") {\r\n      screenSpinner.textContent = \"Failed to capture screen from TV\";\r\n    } else {\r\n      screenTime.textContent = \"Refresh failed — retrying\";\r\n    }\r\n    screenCapturing = false;\r\n    btnRefreshScreen.disabled = false;\r\n    btnRefreshScreen.textContent = \"🔄 Capture / Refresh\";\r\n\r\n    if (chkAutoRefresh && chkAutoRefresh.checked && !boxScreen.classList.contains(\"is-collapsed\")) {\r\n      autoRefreshTimer = setTimeout(fetchScreenshot, 5000);\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n  img.src = url;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction toggleScreenCollapse() {\r\n  var collapsed = boxScreen.classList.toggle(\"is-collapsed\");\r\n  btnToggleScreen.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", collapsed ? \"false\" : \"true\");\r\n  if (collapsed) {\r\n    if (autoRefreshTimer) {\r\n      clearTimeout(autoRefreshTimer);\r\n      autoRefreshTimer = null;\r\n    }\r\n  } else {\r\n    if (!screenImg.src || screenImg.style.display === \"none\") {\r\n      fetchScreenshot();\r\n    } else if (chkAutoRefresh && chkAutoRefresh.checked && !screenCapturing) {\r\n      fetchScreenshot();\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (btnToggleScreen && boxScreen) {\r\n  btnToggleScreen.addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\r\n    e.stopPropagation();\r\n    toggleScreenCollapse();\r\n  });\r\n  if (screenHeader) {\r\n    screenHeader.addEventListener(\"click\", toggleScreenCollapse);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (chkAutoRefresh) {\r\n  chkAutoRefresh.onchange = function () {\r\n    if (chkAutoRefresh.checked) {\r\n      if (!screenCapturing) fetchScreenshot();\r\n    } else {\r\n      if (autoRefreshTimer) clearTimeout(autoRefreshTimer);\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nbtnRefreshScreen.onclick = function () {\r\n  fetchScreenshot();\r\n};\r\n\r\nif (!isTouch) {\r\n  ti.focus();\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n"}}
